    "sentence_translations": [
      "Holland's “Panda Boom”",
      "",
      "Two Giant Pandas flew into Holland from China.",
      "This is the first time that Holland welcomes Giant Pandas.",
      "In order to get the pandas, Holland worked hard for many years.",
      "To greet the pandas, the zoo has built a great beautiful Chinese style panda building for the pandas.",
      "",
      "The two pandas are called Xing Ya and Wu Wen.",
      "Xing Ya is a little sunshine boy who loves running and climbing trees.",
      "Wu Wen is a cute little sister who loves playing with the male and female caretakers.",
      "They will stay in Holland for about 15 years.",
      ""
